# Web Scraping / API Interaction

## GET Request

```python
# https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/

import requests

url = "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1"

response = requests.get(url)

if response.status_code == 200:
    print("Information GET")
    print(response.json())
else:
    print("Error")
```

### Explanation

- `requests.get(url)` → sends a GET request.
- `response.status_code` → checks the HTTP status.
- `200` → request successful.
- `response.json()` → converts the response to Python data.

Change `/posts/1` to `/users/1`, `/comments/1`, `/todos/1`, etc.

