## POST Request

```python
# https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/

import requests

url = "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts"

data = {
    "body": "Kader",
    "title": "test",
    "userId": 1
}

response = requests.post(url, data)

print("Status code:", response.status_code)
print(response.json())
```

### Explanation

- `requests.post(url, data)` → sends data to the API.
- `data` → information sent to the server.
- `response.status_code` → shows the request status.
- `response.json()` → displays the server response.
